@Products.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7172

### Listar productos
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obtener un producto por id
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Accept: application/json

### Crear un producto
POST {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Notebook Dell XPS 15",
  "descripcion": "Laptop 15 pulgadas, 32GB RAM",
  "precio": 1500.00,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoria": "Electrónica"
}

### Actualizar un producto
PUT {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Notebook Dell XPS 15",
  "descripcion": "Laptop 15 pulgadas, 64GB RAM",
  "precio": 1750.00,
  "stock": 8,
  "categoria": "Electrónica"
}

### Eliminar un producto
DELETE {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Listar productos con un Correlation ID propio
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: mi-id-de-prueba-123

### Health check con un Correlation ID propio
GET {{Products.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: mi-id-de-prueba-123